prefix displacements from the published positions, explicitly supplies one
causal target receipt per millisecond, and reruns the pinned original Python
planner and ABCurves-Lib C++ planner. Adds synchronized two-pane playback,
numerical differences, raw sample inspection/download, and source provenance.
These smooth output paths are new matched reruns, not the original frozen
integer Renderer outputs. No upstream endorsement is implied.

